  "body": "Enjoying a sought-after coastal location, just a stone’s throw from the waterfront, this architecturally designed home offers unrivalled value.\r\n\r\nSet on three split levels, the upper level offers two distinct living areas separated by a modern well-appointed kitchen, all capturing attractive water views and enchanting sunsets. Private balconies and sheltered courtyards provide the perfect setting for outdoor living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe entry level offers a spacious guest bedroom, tiled family bathroom, a generous double garage and a separate laundry. Downstairs reveals a large master-suite, with a walk-in-robe and ensuite, and a large slider opening to the private landscaped gardens. An expansive third bedroom could easily transform into an additional living area, home theatre or work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nMeticulous presentation, private tropical themed gardens and additional off-street parking all add further appeal. \r\n\r\nSandy beaches, coastal walkways, waterfront cafes, marina facilities and the City ferry service are all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nIn-zone for Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.",
